### NestBook — Booking & Payment API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Room type from seeded data
@roomTypeId = 9e15c55f-141c-4da3-b7ec-c2a5659129e5

### Set this after creating a booking (copy bookingCode from response)
@bookingCode = NB20260617657811


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. QUOTE — check price before booking
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1.1 Quote — valid request (2 nights, 1 room)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-12",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### 1.2 Quote — multiple rooms (3 nights, 2 rooms)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-15",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-18",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 1.3 Quote — invalid date range (checkout before checkin) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-12",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-10",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### 1.4 Quote — invalid roomTypeId → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-12",
  "quantity": 1
}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. CREATE BOOKING
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2.1 Create booking — valid (copy bookingCode from response → set @bookingCode above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-12",
  "quantity": 1,
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "customerEmail": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "0901234567"
}

###

### 2.2 Create booking — missing required field (customerPhone) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-12",
  "quantity": 1,
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "customerEmail": "nguyenvana@example.com"
}

###

### 2.3 Create booking — invalid email → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-12",
  "quantity": 1,
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "customerEmail": "not-an-email",
  "customerPhone": "0901234567"
}

###

### 2.4 Create booking — quantity 0 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-12",
  "quantity": 0,
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "customerEmail": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "0901234567"
}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. GET BOOKING
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3.1 Get booking by code — valid
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingCode}}

###

### 3.2 Get booking by code — not found → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/NBNOTEXIST000000

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. CONFIRM PAYMENT  (creates invoice automatically)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4.1 Confirm payment — valid (booking must be PENDING_PAYMENT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingCode}}/pay

###

### 4.2 Confirm payment again — already paid → 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingCode}}/pay

###

### 4.3 Confirm payment — booking not found → 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/NBNOTEXIST000000/pay

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. CANCEL BOOKING
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5.1 Create a fresh booking to cancel
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2026-10-01",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-10-03",
  "quantity": 1,
  "customerName": "Tran Thi B",
  "customerEmail": "tranthib@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "0987654321"
}

###

### 5.2 Cancel booking — valid (update @bookingCode to the new one first)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingCode}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Change of plans"
}

###

### 5.3 Cancel booking — no reason (optional field)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingCode}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 5.4 Cancel booking — already cancelled → 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingCode}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Try to cancel again"
}

###
